  "limitations": [
    "AI browser actions do not count as real research participants.",
    "Samples cover a small MLP and one dual-input Add graph; they do not certify all views, all 17 modules, global route aesthetics, publication size, performance, or arbitrary branch diagrams.",
    "Add dual-input labels remain physically small at overview scale; hit rectangles and tail clicks were observed, but this is not a typography acceptance gate.",
    "Tooltip placement scores node obstacles but does not avoid edges/markers and can still cover a node in dense no-clear regions; branch coverage remains open.",
    "One long Chinese frame and one dual-input tail frame have explicit pixelSynchrony failures and are retained; settled replacements are separately named.",
    "Saving/reopen was verified after service recovery; the earlier stopped-service save failure remains a historical attempt."
  ],
  "pixelReview": "Every listed JPEG was visually inspected by the root agent and the independent palette readback agent; only settled frames are usable for their bounded claims."
}
